interpretation = f'SpO₂ desaturation episodes detected: <90% n={summary_90['n_episodes']} (median duration {summary_90['duration_min_median']:.2f} min; median drop rate {summary_90['drop_rate_median_spo2_per_min']:.2f} %/min; median recovery rate {summary_90['recovery_rate_median_spo2_per_min']:.2f} %/min; abrupt-flag fraction {summary_90['abrupt_artifact_like_fraction']:.2f}), and <80% n={summary_80['n_episodes']} (median duration {summary_80['duration_min_median']:.2f} min; median drop rate {summary_80['drop_rate_median_spo2_per_min']:.2f} %/min; median recovery rate {summary_80['recovery_rate_median_spo2_per_min']:.2f} %/min), supporting separation of short, high-rate dips (potential artifact) from longer, slower physiologic desaturations.'

